class=3D"field-items"><div class=3D"field-item even"><p>Exciting news! Drup=
aljam :open up is in the works, gearing up for a spectacular anniversary ye=
ar featuring compelling speakers. In line with jubilee traditions, this edi=
tion is poised to surpass its predecessors. While maintaining the quality y=
ou've come to expect, we're introducing refreshing changes, ensuring this y=
ear's event stands out as truly unique. </p>
<p>Get ready for a Drupaljam :open up experience like never before!</p>
<h2>Opening Key note: Dries Buytaert,</h2>
<p>We're thrilled to unveil that the opening keynote speaker for the 20th e=
dition of Drupaljam is none other than the founder of Drupal, Dries Buytaer=
t. Mark your calendars and make your way to De Fabrique in Utrecht for an e=
xtraordinary day, where you'll have the unique opportunity to meet Dries in=
 person, immersing yourself in all the latest developments surrounding Drup=
al.</p>
<h2>Event Highlights</h2>
<p><strong>Engaging Sessions:</strong> Dive into a diverse range of session=
s, workshops, and discussions led by Drupal experts, offering insights, tip=
s, and best practices.</p>
<p><strong>Inclusive Community</strong>: Connect with like-minded Drupal en=
thusiasts, contributors, and professionals from all walks of life, fosterin=
g diversity and inclusion.</p>
<p><strong>Open-Source Excellence</strong>: Explore how Drupal's open-sourc=
e nature fuels innovation, adaptability, and continuous improvement.</p>
<p><strong>Networking Opportunities</strong>: Connect tot friends, open up =
to newcomers, Build valuable connections, share experiences, and expand you=
r network in a welcoming environment.</p>
<p><strong>Social and Fun</strong>: Enjoy social events, meetups, and fun a=
ctivities designed to strengthen the bonds within the Drupal community.</p>=
